sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Board as Board page (useMessages)
    participant API as GraphQL API
    participant Svc as MessageService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant PubSub
    participant Sub as Other connected clients

    User->>Board: write message, click Send
    Board->>API: mutation createMessage(userId, content)
    API->>Svc: create(userId, content)
    Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO messages
    DB-->>Svc: saved message
    Svc->>PubSub: publish("messageAdded", message)
    PubSub-->>Sub: subscription messageAdded push
    Svc-->>API: Message
    API-->>Board: { id, content, userId }
    Board->>API: refetch getMessages(page=1)
    API->>Svc: findAll(1, limit)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT messages ...
    API-->>Board: paginated items

    note over Board,API: Message.user field is resolved lazily<br/>via UserLoader (DataLoader), batching all<br/>author lookups for the page into one query
